      "writtenOn": "2024-01-09T18:26:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `raw_data` is used in the I2C bus read/write functions to access the request/response buffer byte by byte. Ideally the size would be the largest struct within their respective unions.  I\u0027m trying to break up testing each PDC API into their own CL.  Each CL will be defining more structs within their unions so this may keep changing until all PDC API tests are fully written.  I prefer to keep this as is for now.",
